# Inkling 2 Mini — Platform-Optimized Local Stack, Inner-Loop Steering & Research-Injection Loop

**Deep systems optimization, context architecture analysis, pass-targeted inner-loop steering, outer research-injection proxy, and targeted post-training pipeline for Thinking Machines Lab's `Inkling-2-Mini` (26.4B total / ~3.4B–5.4B active Looped MoE, 1M context, multimodal).**

---

## Pure-C# .NET 10 Glacier Ecosystem & Technical Whitepaper

> **100% Native C# / .NET 10 — Zero `llama-server`, Zero Python Inference or Training Runtime:** While the scripts below preserve our earlier Python/`llama.cpp` experiments, the production **Glacier** stack executes Inkling-2-Mini **end-to-end in pure C# on .NET 10** — custom D3D12 HLSL compute kernels (NVIDIA RTX 4060 / RTX 3060 & AMD Radeon 890M), Zen 5 `AVX-512BW` (`VNNI`) hybrid MoE fallback, official Inkling-2 control-token templating, SWA/ShortConv GPU prefix checkpointing, in-process multi-stage agentic coding, and local KL-regularized LoRA post-training.

- **Full Engineering Whitepaper:** [**`docs/WHITEPAPER_PURE_CSHARP_INKLING2.md`**](docs/WHITEPAPER_PURE_CSHARP_INKLING2.md)
- **Explore the Pure-C# Glacier Stack:**
  - [**`Glacier.Inference`**](https://github.com/ian-cowley/Glacier.Inference) — Native C# GGUF/NVFP4 engine, D3D12 HLSL shaders, `AVX-512BW` kernels, SWA/ShortConv prefix checkpointing & `Inkling2HeadLoraAdapter`
  - [**`Glacier.Tune`**](https://github.com/ian-cowley/Glacier.Tune) — Pure-C# `.NET 10` LoRA trainer (`Inkling2Dataset`, FP16 GPU hidden-state cache, exact KL-regularized `Inkling2HeadLoraTrainer`)
  - [**`Glacier.Agent`**](https://github.com/ian-cowley/Glacier.Agent) — In-process `SequentialAgent`, `FunctionTool`, and `BeforeToolCall` LoopGuard (`132/132` unit tests passing)
  - [**`Glacier.Cli`**](https://github.com/ian-cowley/Glacier.Cli) — Single-binary CLI host (`glacier run ...`) across CPU, NVIDIA D3D12, and AMD 890M
  - [**`Glacier.Grep`**](https://github.com/ian-cowley/Glacier.Grep) — Zero-alloc `.NET 10` SIMD + `MemoryMappedFile` + MCP search engine *(held-out benchmark blueprint)*
  - Supporting crates: [`Glacier.Quant`](https://github.com/ian-cowley/Glacier.Quant) | [`Glacier.Gpu`](https://github.com/ian-cowley/Glacier.Gpu) | [`Glacier.Tensor`](https://github.com/ian-cowley/Glacier.Tensor) | [`Glacier.Formats`](https://github.com/ian-cowley/Glacier.Formats) | [`Glacier.Serve`](https://github.com/ian-cowley/Glacier.Serve)
- **Held-Out Pure-C# Benchmark Artifacts:** [`results/pure_glacier_oracle.json`](results/pure_glacier_oracle.json) | [`results/pure_glacier_grep.json`](results/pure_glacier_grep.json)

